  "body": "Summer afternoons by the pool, barefoot walks across the road to Fisherman's Cove to catch fish for dinner, and enough space for the whole crew - including all the cars, the boat and toys. This is the kind of home where family naturally gathers, stays a little longer and everyone makes themselves at home. Just moments from Army Bay beach, 1257 Whangaparaoa Road features five bedrooms, three bathrooms, multiple living areas, extensive front and rear decks and even an inground swimming pool. All at a price point that might surprise you!\r\n\r\nWith a number of upgrades throughout, there's a solid foundation here to enjoy now while adding your own ideas over time. It's a home with the space, flexibility and potential to evolve with your family and become your own.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Fully fenced, 875sqm freehold section with scope to further landscape\r\n* Approx. 255sqm, 5 bedroom family home\r\n* Supersized, open plan living spaces\r\n* Three bathrooms, including a large ensuite to the master bedroom\r\n* Updated kitchen and bathrooms\r\n* Large inground swimming pool\r\n* Spacious front and rear decks for outdoor entertaining\r\n* Heat pump and fireplace for cosy cooler evenings\r\n* Work-from-home flexibility\r\n* Rear parking for multiple vehicles, boat or campervan\r\n* Multiple garden sheds for extra storage\r\n* Potential for additional garaging or a shed, subject to requirements\r\n* Excellent nearby schools including Wentworth College & Primary\r\n\r\nHere, the best of Gulf Harbour is close at hand. Head to local cafes for coffee, or launch the boat and get out on the water at nearby Army Bay boat ramp. The peaceful surroundings give this home a relaxed coastal feel, while Gulf Harbour's marina, beaches, excellent schools, shops and wider Whangaparaoa Peninsula amenities are all within easy reach. It is a location that makes everyday life feel a little more like a holiday.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the scale, versatility and lifestyle for yourself - we'd love to show you through.\r\n\r\nDEADLINE SALE: Closes Wednesday 11th November at 4:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/G752\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.",
